{"id":623,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"There’s a theory that inside Golurk is a perpetual motion machine that produces limitless energy, but this belief hasn’t been proven."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Artillery platforms built into the walls of ancient castles served as perches from which Golurk could fire energy beams."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"When the seal on its chest is removed, it rages indiscriminately, turning the whole town around it into a mountain of rubble."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Some say that ancient people invented Golurk to serve as a laborer. It follows its master’s orders faithfully."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Black"],"text":"It flies across the sky at Mach speeds. Removing the seal on its chest makes its internal energy go out of control."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White"],"text":"It is said that Golurk were ordered to protect people and Pokémon by the ancient people who made them."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Golurk were created to protect people and Pokémon. They run on a mysterious energy."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Iron Fist","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up punching moves."},{"name":"Klutz","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon can't use any held items."},{"name":"No Guard","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon employs no-guard tactics to ensure incoming and outgoing attacks always land."}],"eggGroups":["Mineral"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":25,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Green","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":622,"name":"Golett","condition":null,"children":[{"id":623,"name":"Golurk","condition":"Lv. 43","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,1],[1,111],[1,310],[1,667],[12,325],[16,174],[20,101],[24,707],[28,334],[32,5],[36,247],[40,484],[46,566],[52,359],[58,89],[64,223]],"machine":[776,34,280,523,451,370,109,174,91,38,409,414,89,203,263,7,430,374,19,411,264,416,447,356,360,912,535,484,270,506,667,63,58,8,196,286